⚡🇮🇱🇮🇷🇦🇪 Channel 13 in Israel says Donald Trump sent a message to Gulf states warning that if no deal is reached with Iran by this week, they should prepare for a significant escalation with Iran.

The network says Israeli and regional sources believe Trump is using the threat to pressure Iran into accepting a ceasefire and reopening the Strait of Hormuz.

